  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">外资精译</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">摩根士丹利：腾讯Hy4发布，视觉与电脑操作能力扩展</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">腾讯在11月4日发布Hy4，MS这份报告最值得看的判断不是榜单排名，而是模型能力开始向“能干活”靠近：它同时补上视觉理解与电脑操作，并在办公协作、资金、前端与游戏开发等腾讯自建评测里给出可核验的<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>。对关注企业AI落地的人来说，这比单次跑分更能说明产品方向。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXEJ8XXR1lOly3JicQPPCeI8o2g9v08yNZSmrzoj4ZkQTiaJcBU1nxosfdJjsYz4JoQUM7yyZMI7URAib6SEmAqzMSQ7GQEdeV4GA/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"assets/source_image_01.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWjuAWfyymvqqk8otuiaUPxspQHmmWT3ocTgalw29kIMt3hURa5DTty7ib5Bg6tmdf7FNH9e2gpFOV4LFfbGVXFxvpeYq5iaShUCE/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"assets/source_image_02.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWZQ0QCySvJDsy5QibqVhibjjYIDcZFCpKpXchKGpSbbI3DDTwibLLybHBJO3Bpt37picjLwhG3xiaQwicmJjrIvibczQ75B48zWtianaE/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"assets/source_image_03.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<section style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#737D8C;font-size:12px;line-height:1.75\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">——人工智能免责声明（部分内容由人工智能工具辅助生成）</p><p style=\"margin:0\">撰稿：James<br>责编：KC<br>排版：胡桃</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXoBHLobkOYiaiaGKyRBVHAOyI6SibU7hbAdp55Uv6S4MiaVcdicXZFiaLibFyTCzTia2K5LtfZWXMnC0t5zgUF9d88lOdF3y9NCg4X1YM/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"KC桌面\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 34-MS-Tencent Holdings Ltd. - Asia Pacific Hy4 Released-Broader Capabilities with Vision and Computer Use-261104</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
